  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA distributed value fell 99.8% over 30D:</strong> On-chain RWA distributed value at $28.80M (99.8% lower over 30D) hints that tokenized asset growth paused or reversed\u2014more consistent with risk-off allocation or redemptions than a pure news cycle. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/stablecoins-us-dollar-dominance-treasury-demand-boe?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Stablecoin growth could boost dollar dominance, US Treasury demand: BoE official</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/tradfi-and-fintech/bitget-wallet-integrates-reality-tokenized-us-stocks-rtokens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bitget Wallet Adds Reality&#x27;s Tokenized U.S. Stocks Alongside Ondo And xStocks</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Institutional commitments are still a leading share signal:</strong> Bank and asset-manager distribution deals often shift platform and network leadership before headline RWA totals fully catch up. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/deutsche-bank-regulatory-nod-institutional-crypto-custody?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Deutsche Bank awaits regulatory nod to launch institutional crypto custody solutions</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-09-15-this-one-stings-clarity-act-fails-senate-is-cryptos-biggest-regulatory-push-dead-415135\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\u2018This one stings\u2019: Clarity Act fails procedural Senate vote \u2014 is crypto\u2019s biggest regulatory push dead?</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
